---
import Main from "../layouts/main.astro";
import Social from "../components/social.astro";
---

<Main title="Charlotte :3">
  <div class="bg-ctp-base/40 gap-4 rounded-2xl p-4 text-base backdrop-blur-sm md:grid md:h-128 md:w-4xl md:grid-cols-3 md:grid-rows-3">
    <div class="col-span-2 row-span-1 flex w-full flex-row items-center gap-4 rounded-lg p-4">
      <img
        src="/img/pfp.jpg"
        class="h-32 w-32 rounded-full"
        alt="Charlotte's profile picture"
      />
      <div class="text-ctp-subtext1 row-span-1 flex flex-col">
        <h1 class="text-ctp-lavender text-4xl font-bold">Charlotte</h1>
        <span class="text-lg">
          <span
            id="username"
            class="font-medium"
          >
            @stressfulpuppy
          </span>
          <span> • she/her</span>
        </span>
        <div class="text-ctp-subtext0 mt-2 flex flex-row gap-1 text-3xl">
          <Social
            hover="@stressfulpuppy"
            icon="fa7-brands:github"
            link="https://github.com/stressfulpuppy"
          />
          <Social
            hover="@stressfulpuppy"
            icon="fa7-brands:discord"
            link="https://discord.com/users/1408956378600702042"
          />
          <Social
            hover="@catgirlpuppy.01"
            icon="fa7-brands:signal-messenger"
            link="https://signal.me/#eu/Yj2KIwG3CTRCPVOJPg7bm_Mmagzpjq17UnbhWO3buIVFRpti6-RJmJZxrgISZDgo"
          />
          <Social
            hover="@stressfulpuppy"
            icon="fa7-brands:twitter"
            link="https://twitter.com/stressfulpuppy"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="text-ctp-subtext1 rounded-lg p-2 text-lg leading-relaxed md:col-span-2 md:row-span-2">
      <h2 class="text-ctp-text text-2xl font-bold">about me</h2>
      <p>im charlotte, a sixteen-year-old stressed puppygirl <span class="text-nowrap">:(</span></p>
      <p>i'm a furry, too. my self-named sona (who's part-cat, part-dog) is loosely based off the colours of the monster ultra fantasy ruby red can!</p>
      <p>i'm reasonably comfortable with astro and javascript, and i hope to major in IT, assuming that's still an industry when I graduate... day to day, i use windows & vscode, and an ipad from my school. i am reasonably comfortable using linux on both servers and clients</p>
    </div>

    <div class="text-ctp-subtext1 rounded-lg p-2 text-lg md:col-span-1 md:col-start-3 md:row-span-3 md:row-start-1">
      <h2 class="text-ctp-text text-2xl font-bold">projects!!</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <h3 class="text-ctp-green text-xl font-semibold underline-offset-2 hover:underline">
            <a
              href="https://tadpole.cattreats.dev"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              >tadpole</a
            >
          </h3>
          <p>tadpole is a lightweight file host with discord authentication, written in astro and typescript.</p>
          <a
            href="https://github.com/stressfulpuppy/tadpole"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="text-ctp-subtext0 hover:text-ctp-green underline underline-offset-2"
            >source</a
          >
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3 class="text-ctp-red text-xl font-semibold underline-offset-2 hover:underline">nestrec</h3>
          <p>nestrec is a hardware and software <span class="font-bold">rec</span>reation of the google <span class="font-bold">nest</span> hub, intended to be more private. i hope that once i finish it, i can make it open source! but, like everything, i'm held back by cost of parts.</p>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="bg-ctp-base/40 text-ctp-subtext0 mt-6 mb-4 rounded-full p-2 underline underline-offset-2 backdrop-blur-md md:mb-0">
    <a
      href="http://github.com/stressfulpuppy/cattreats.dev"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
    >
      made by a puppy. <span class="text-nowrap">:3</span>
    </a>
  </div>
</Main>
